message: "If you use The Hidden Parrot: RAG Poisoning POC in research or security tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "The Hidden Parrot: RAG Poisoning POC"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2025-11-11"
abstract: >-
  The Hidden Parrot is a reproducible teaching proof of concept demonstrating
  RAG poisoning through indirect prompt injection in a retrieval corpus.
  It compares responses from a clean knowledge base with responses after
  adding a single poisoned document, using LangChain, ChromaDB, and
  sentence-transformer embeddings to show how retrieved instructions can
  influence a language model's behavior.
